      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Egyd-Egydmd egy-demp">
               <pb n="R" />
               <lb n="1" />ꜥꜣ.w ı͗w=w r ꜥw r ḏnf=w <lb n="2" />(n-)ḏr.t.ṱ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1160">Ḥr sꜣ <surname>Pa-sny</surname></persName> r.ḏı͗ n=f <lb n="3" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1000">Ḥr-nfr sꜣ <surname>H̱nm-nb-nꜣy=y-sꜥnḫ</surname></persName>
               <lb n="4" />ꜣsw 1.t r ḏnf 3 <lb n="5" />(n-)ḏr.t.ṱ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1000">Ḥr-nfr sꜣ <surname>H̱nm-(nb-)nꜣy=y-sꜥnḫ</surname></persName>
               <lb n="6" />ꜣsw 2.t r ḏnf 5 qd.t 7 wp-s.t <lb n="7" />wꜥ.t r ḏnf qd.t 7 <lb n="8" />r.ı͗n=w r ḥ.t-nṯr n <placeName ref="places.xml#s2">N.t</placeName> wꜥ.t r <lb n="9" />ḏnf 5 <lb n="10" />dmḏ st ḏbꜥ (n-)ḏr.t.ṱ=y ḏr=w <lb n="11" />my ṯꜣy=w s r ḥ.t-nb <lb n="12" />pšn=ṯn wbꜣ <lb n="13" />nꜣ rmṯ.w nty ı͗r wp.t <lb n="14" />pꜣ ḫsbḏ n mꜣꜥ ḏı͗=y <lb n="15" />šm=w r <placeName ref="places.xml#s1344">Mn-nfr </placeName>(r-)dbꜣ=f <lb n="16" />sẖ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p2210">Ḏd-ḥr sꜣ <surname>Nꜣ-nfr-ı͗b-Rꜥ</surname></persName>
               <lb n="17" />n <date notAfter="-279-05-16" notBefore="-299-05-21" when-custom="Ptolemaic Dynasty (early)">ḥsb.t 6 ı͗bd 3 pr.t sw 21</date>
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang=" en">
               <pb n="" />
               <lb n="1" />Gemstones(?) which will be huge (i.e measured?) by their estimate. <lb n="2" />From Horos, son of Pasenis: That which has given to him <lb n="3" />Harnouphis, son of Chnoum-neb-nai-seanch: <lb n="4" />1st sac: By estimate 3 (deben). <lb n="5" />From Harnouphis, son of Chnoum-(neb)-nai-seanch: <lb n="6" />2nd sac: By estimate 5 (deben), 7 kite. Specification: <lb n="7" />One (sac), by estimate 7 kite. <lb n="8" />That what was delivered into the temple of Thebes: One (sac), by <lb n="9" />estimate 5 (deben) <lb n="10" />in total. They were sealed all by my (own) hand. <lb n="11" />They may be brought into the house of gold! <lb n="12" />Take care of <lb n="13" />the people working (with the gemstones)! <lb n="14" />Because of the genuine lapis lazuli I caused <lb n="15" />them to be sent to Memphis. <lb n="16" />Written by Teos, son of Nepherpres, <lb n="17" />in the 6th regnal year, 21st of Phamenoth. </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text></TEI>